Name "HDPE_Pellet"

Every 1 ticks do

    Input FE:: From Energy 
        Output FE:: To Each Rotary Bottom Side
    forget

    Input FE:: From Energy 
        Output FE:: To Each Pressurized_Chamber Bottom Side
    forget

End

Every 20 ticks do

    Input fluid:mekanism:ethene From Liquid_Ethene Top Side 
        Output fluid:mekanism:ethene To Each Rotary Bottom Side
    forget

    Input gas:mekanism:ethene From Each Rotary Top Side Slots 0
        Output gas:mekanism:ethene To Each Pressurized_Chamber Bottom Side
    forget

    Input fluid:kubejs:radical_initiator From Radical_Initiator Top Side 
        Output fluid:kubejs:radical_initiator To Each Pressurized_Chamber Bottom Side
    forget

    Input mekanism:substrate From Substrate Top Side 
        Output retain 16 mekanism:substrate To Each Pressurized_Chamber Bottom Side
    forget

    Input mekanism:hdpe_pellet From Each Pressurized_Chamber Top Side Slots 0
        Output mekanism:hdpe_pellet To Hdpe_Collactor Bottom Side
    forget
End

